ositions bitvector</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#666666;--ltx-fill-color:#FAFAFA;" fill="#FAFAFA" stroke="#666666"><path d="M 440.08 -70.16 L 335.38 -70.16 C 333.85 -70.16 332.61 -71.4 332.61 -72.93 L 332.61 -113.15 C 332.61 -114.68 333.85 -115.92 335.38 -115.92 L 440.08 -115.92 C 441.61 -115.92 442.85 -114.68 442.85 -113.15 L 442.85 -72.93 C 442.85 -71.4 441.61 -70.16 440.08 -70.16 Z M 332.61 -115.92"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 349.93 -101.69)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 22.14)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 8.65)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_r" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.38em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="68.85"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.I1.i1.pic1.9" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;">Kept tokens </span><math id="S3.I1.i1.pic1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{S}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic" mathsize="0.900em">𝒮</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{S}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 19.72)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_r" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0.07 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.9em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="75.47"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.I1.i1.pic1.10" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;">entropy-coded</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#666666;--ltx-fill-color:#FAFAFA;" fill="#FAFAFA" stroke="#666666"><path d="M 831.18 22.36 L 710.73 22.36 C 709.2 22.36 707.96 21.12 707.96 19.59 L 707.96 -19.59 C 707.96 -21.12 709.2 -22.36 710.73 -22.36 L 831.18 -22.36 C 832.71 -22.36 833.95 -21.12 833.95 -19.59 L 833.95 19.59 C 833.95 21.12 832.71 22.36 831.18 22.36 Z M 707.96 -22.36"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 736.23 -7.44)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 21.1)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 8.65)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_r" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 6.54 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:4.4em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="8.65" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="56.36"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.I1.i1.pic1.11" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;">MLM infill</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 17.99)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_r" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.43em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="69.45"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><math id="S3.I1.i1.pic1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\arg\max\,q_{\theta}(\cdot)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathsize="0.900em">arg</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mi mathsize="0.900em">max</mi></mrow><mo lspace="0.337em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">q</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">(</mo><mo lspace="0em" mathsize="0.900em" rspace="0em">⋅</mo><mo maxsize="0.900em" minsize="0.900em">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\arg\max\,q_{\theta}(\cdot)</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g></g></g><g stroke-width="0.6pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 55.39 0 L 118.79 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 118.79 0)"><path d="M 5.81 0 C 5.1 0.17 1.96 1.16 0 2.23 L 0 -2.23 C 1.96 -1.16 5.1 -0.17 5.81 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.6pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 261.47 0 L 324.86 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 324.86 0)"><path d="M 5.81 0 C 5.1 0.17 1.96 1.16 0 2.23 L 0 -2.23 C 1.96 -1.16 5.1 -0.17 5.81 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.6pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 443.12 0 L 506.52 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 506.52 0)"><path d="M 5.81 0 C 5.1 0.17 1.96 1.16 0 2.23 L 0 -2.23 C 1.96 -1.16 5.1 -0.17 5.81 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.6pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 387.73 -22.64 L 387.73 -62.41"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(0.0 -1.0 1.0 0.0 387.73 -62.41)"><path d="M 5.81 0 C 5.1 0.17 1.96 1.16 0 2.23 L 0 -2.23 C 1.96 -1.16 5.1 -0.17 5.81 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.6pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 636.82 0 L 700.22 0"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 700.22 0)"><path d="M 5.81 0 C 5.1 0.17 1.96 1.16 0 2.23 L 0 -2.23 C 1.96 -1.16 5.1 -0.17 5.81 0 Z"></path></g></g><g stroke-width="0.6pt"><path style="fill:none" d="M 443.12 -93.04 L 770.96 -93.04 L 770.96 -30.11"></path><g stroke-dasharray="none" stroke-dashoffset="0.0pt" stroke-linejoin="miter" transform="matrix(0.0 1.0 -1.0 0.0 770.96 -30.11)"><path d="M 5.81 0 C 5.1 0.17 1.96 1.16 0 2.23 L 0 -2.23 C 1.96 -1.16 5.1 -0.17 5.81 0 Z"></path></g></g></g></svg></span></span></span>
</span></span></span></p>
</span></div>
</div>
                
<figure id="S3.F1" class="ltx_figure ltx_align_center">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="S3.F1.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure 1</span>: </span><span id="S3.F1.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Predictive Masking pipeline.</span></figcaption>
</figure>
              
</div></li>
<li id="S3.I1.i2" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S3.I1.i2.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i2.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Error-Bounded Predictive Coding (EPC).</span>
EPC begins identically to PM by selecting a mask set <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math>. However, instead of discarding the original tokens at masked positions, it introduces a residual stream. For each masked position <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\in\mathcal{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℳ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\in\mathcal{M}</annotation></semantics></math>, if the model’s top-1 prediction is incorrect, EPC stores a minimal correction. Let <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> be the rank of the true token <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{i}</annotation></semantics></math> in the model’s predictive distribution. If <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}&gt;1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}&gt;1</annotation></semantics></math>, EPC transmits an override flag followed by a compact representation of the correction. For ranks <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="2\leq r_{i}\leq K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>≤</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">2\leq r_{i}\leq K</annotation></semantics></math> (where <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> is a hyperparameter), this correction is the rank index. For ranks <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r_{i}&gt;K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r_{i}&gt;K</annotation></semantics></math>, EPC can optionally transmit the full token, allowing for lossless reconstruction of the masked subset. This design provides two controls: <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="p_{\text{mask}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>p</mi><mtext>mask</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">p_{\text{mask}}</annotation></semantics></math> trades kept tokens for model predictions, while the rank threshold <math id="S3.I1.i2.p1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math> controls the trade-off between the correction stream’s bit rate and its error-bounding capability (Figure <a href="#S3.F2" title="Figure 2 ‣ 2nd item ‣ Stage 2: Compression Codecs. ‣ 3.1 Compression Pipeline ‣ 3 Methodology ‣ The Lossy Horizon: Error-Bounded Predictive Coding for Lossy Text Compression (Episode I)" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>).</p>
</div>
<div id="S3.I1.i2.2" class="ltx_logical-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_middle" style="width:345.0pt;">
                
<div id="S3.I1.i2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<div id="S3.I1.i2.p2.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:48.5pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(-167.2pt,23.5pt) scale(0.5,0.5) ;">
<p id="S3.I1.i2.p2.1.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="S3.I1.i2.p2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text">
<span id="S3.I1.i2.p2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:679.5pt;height:95.6pt;vertical-align:-0.0pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(0.0pt,0.0pt) scale(1,1) ;">
