class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;"> by surprisal</span></span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#666666;--ltx-fill-color:#FAFAFA;" fill="#FAFAFA" stroke="#666666"><path d="M 453.08 23.57 L 340.51 23.57 C 338.98 23.57 337.74 22.33 337.74 20.81 L 337.74 -20.81 C 337.74 -22.33 338.98 -23.57 340.51 -23.57 L 453.08 -23.57 C 454.61 -23.57 455.85 -22.33 455.85 -20.81 L 455.85 20.81 C 455.85 22.33 454.61 23.57 453.08 23.57 Z M 337.74 -23.57"></path></g><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 354.67 -8.65)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 23.52)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 8.65)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_r" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:5.72em;--ltx-fo-height:0.68em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.19em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="11.07" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 8.65)" width="73.19"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.I1.i2.pic1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="font-size:90%;">Override flag </span><math id="S3.I1.i2.pic1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="z_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">z</mi><mi mathsize="0.900em">i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">z_{i}</annotation></semantics></math></span></span></foreignObject></g></g><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_row" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 20.41)"><g class="ltx_tikzmatrix_col ltx_nopad_r" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 20.6 0)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:1.25em;--ltx-fo-height:0.73em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.24em;font-size:9.25pt;" height="12.45" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.34)" width="16"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="S3.I1.i2.pic1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" styl